{"qid": "lb31_0001", "category": "provision", "bucket": "b2", "method": "legalgate", "seed": 0, "split": "lawbench_smoke", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 20.14, "n_tokens": 314, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "B", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.14285714285714285, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 556, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "cited_golden=False key_recall=0.14 (>=0.30)", "answer": "《刑法》第一百二十八条 违反枪支管理规定，非法持有、私藏枪支、弹药的，处三年以下有期徒刑、拘役或者管制；情节严重的，处三年以上七年以下有期徒刑。\n（来源：https://github.com/13098806890/laws-data  json/法律/中华人民共和国刑法_20201226.json）\n\n《刑法》第一百二十八条 依法配备公务用枪的人员，非法出租、出借枪支的，依照前款的规定处罚。\n（来源：https://github.com/13098806890/laws-data  json/法律/中华人民共和国刑法_20201226.json）\n\n《刑法》第一百二十八条 依法配置枪支的人员，非法出租、出借枪支，造成严重后果的，依照第一款的规定处罚。\n（来源：https://github.com/13098806890/laws-data  json/法律/中华人民共和国刑法_20201226.json）\n\n《刑法》第一百二十八条 单位犯第二款、第三款罪的，对单位判处罚金，并对其直接负责的主管人员和其他直接责任人员，依照第一款的规定处罚。\n（来源：https://github.com/13098806890/laws-data  json/法律/中华人民共和国刑法_20201226.json）", "trace": {"channel": "B", "slots": {"law_short": "刑法", "article_no": 128, "paragraph_no": null, "item_no": null, "case_no_raw": null, "topic": null, "temporal_query": false, "law_validity_query": false, "provision_seeking": true, "inherited": []}, "steps": ["temporal_check", "provision_render"], "temporal": {"status": "现行有效", "is_safe": true, "warning": null, "replacement": null, "chain": null, "as_of": "2026-09-15", "matched_law": "刑法"}, "validity_status": "现行有效", "provision_hits": 4, "source_url": "https://github.com/13098806890/laws-data  json/法律/中华人民共和国刑法_20201226.json", "u": null, "tau_b": null, "bucket": "b2", "slots_inherited": [], "decision": "route=B reason=law+article", "latency_ms": 12.5, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "must_show_warning": false,